<!--ENGLISH TEXT-->
	<!--MOD INFO-->
		<Row Tag="LOC_NEW_ADJACENCY_BONUS_BY_RUIVO_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>[COLOR:ResGoldLabelCS][Future is Now] Modular Adjacency Bonuses[ENDCOLOR] · [COLOR:PiratesButtonCS]Core[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_NEW_ADJACENCY_BONUS_BY_RUIVO_TEASER" Language="en_US">
			<Text>This mod introduces a brand new adjacency bonus system.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_NEW_ADJACENCY_BONUS_BY_RUIVO_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>[COLOR_FLOAT_CULTURE][ICON_new]This mod introduces a brand new adjacency bonus system that is compatible with almost all mods except in extreme cases.[ENDCOLOR][newline][newline][COLOR_FLOAT_SCIENCE][ICON_new]This mod adds a variety of new adjacency bonuses and can reproduce all possible adjacency bonuses from the vanilla game. On this basis, it allows for more controllable extensions.[newline][ICON_new]Adjacency types include but are not limited to: each adjacent River edge (distinct from the vanilla Commercial Hub's single river adjacency), each adjacent Citizen working a tile (fully expandable to a specialist system).[newline][ICON_new]Adjacency bonus yields include the 6 vanilla yields plus broader yields like Housing, Amenities, Loyalty, and Power.[newline][ICON_new]Additionally, most objects can serve as adjacency sources: Buildings, Policies, Technologies, Civics, Beliefs, etc., and can be re-triggered: e.g., a bonus from a Civilization/Leader Trait can be triggered again by a Building or other object.[ENDCOLOR][newline][newline][COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD][ICON_new]Thanks to all the modder seniors/predecessors for their patient guidance and help, and to the vast number of Civ 6 players for their enthusiastic testing and playing. We work together to create a new future for Civ 6![ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>
